{% Image
   src="https://cdn.bobbeh.io/articles/817cc002-cb07-4952-901a-da767dc35825-pxl_20260513_043732421.night.jpg" /%}

\
I think the results speak for themselves. Each photo was taken with a 5 minute total exposure time. While obviously not perfect, for a phone camera, it is incredible.\

